  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [webdriverio](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio) from `v4.9.8` to `v4.9.11`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>webdriverio/webdriverio</summary>\n\n#### 4.9.11\n-   [`021288e`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/021288e597cc881086801af8f049a6d5ace3d86f) 4.9.11\n-   [`1cfad00`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/1cfad00f911f70592ca03c90c7725a5d45b18d0c) update package-lock.json [ci skip]\n-   [`774b438`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/774b438c60e45b9e194be6effbaeb8c249dcf75f) update changelog - [ci skip]\n-   [`10f2c21`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/10f2c2147308b574d67dc364dbaaf3af47ff93fc) fix eslint\n-   [`cca2420`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/cca2420a4d02cccce41efdbac60c8ae2f7757a4f) handle hook errors before describe blocks more gracefully - closes #&#8203;2259\n-   [`1782052`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/178205264ca3a1aee89289e98d2f7a66b3bc9073) Update unit test\n-   [`9d9f2af`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/9d9f2afdbfc9b6542fd3522436edd2b5b8d0f377) Update status check and update unit tests\n-   [`f5476fa`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/f5476fa1038f53a9d040d74e7cefd84f9b35750b) Move status code check\n-   [`57eb8f3`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/57eb8f3f0f1a898afa2debdf9fa4877414f6e47b) Updated cli query for reporter directories\n-   [`7aa2764`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/7aa2764281ee06ce19ca8020788827a093954e0d) Adding support for wdio-mochawesome-reporter\n#### 4.9.10\n-   [`80c9db7`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/80c9db77351be21eb79cea459e185cec8bb0a060) 4.9.10\n-   [`1f900e3`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/1f900e3354ada59048de80ba2ad844ec4d812e94) revert scroll change\n-   [`43b35e8`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/43b35e8d3ccb007281df4baa44521715a7d3b6dc) update changelog - ci skip\n-   [`cdb8dca`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/cdb8dcabda859bfe58de525c3d2830939566dfa0) make behavior also work with scroll - refs #&#8203;2403\n-   [`026aff8`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/026aff8315f012fecb0ca9df7e35d02cf0e6e748) allow usage for element as 1st citizen for getHTML and isVisibleWithinViewport - closes #&#8203;1879\n-   [`422dae6`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/422dae6560008c2ed43e6dd76dcf03bc686c584c) label request successful if statuscode is 200\n-   [`209fad1`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/209fad10858a3b0c95226a8ea113f34495cc6455) Add process.stdout.isTTY\n-   [`c1d5ce3`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/c1d5ce3c39558943bcee072e4889a2b9915683fd) Fix header typo\n-   [`e78fb83`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/e78fb83b7f6f673d6087b311f7b11b52a0d98d62) Support Kobiton cloud service\n#### 4.9.9\n-   [`6a22af8`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/6a22af8c50d7a73f5ffe6855dd173fa481bfab5a) 4.9.9\n-   [`413dd14`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/413dd14d990d408df9df0b8db6c868aac7adcda8) update changelog\n-   [`f878fba`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/f878fbaa78f8d083e6fe0dacad5f770166b7ff96) Enable support for both --inspect and --debug\n-   [`e7ee466`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/e7ee466df832e70945507af3411aeaa1e8d437c3) docs: add missing val\n-   [`b995b82`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/b995b8261d0c2757728430971d71b0e6d688dc62) fix #&#8203;2453\n-   [`87db938`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/87db9381600914ecd6f1b37d4b4ea2fcd46bb0f5) Update touchId.js\n-   [`0b5062a`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/0b5062aec94e313f0e770d1497f713c75f3fb18b) Fixing arguments orders in rotate.js\n-   [`34a7d74`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/34a7d74531844a8756b12fe35e771ebaee97f705) Update inherit config example\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
